      "id": "Kreisverkehr.DvbMetadataDecoder",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This fork is no longer actively maintained and will not be developed further. I started [DvbMetadataDecoder](https://github.com/Kreisverkehr/DvbMetadataDecoder) as a clean, independent implementation rather than continuing this fork, with the goal of keeping the decoder understandable and straightforward to improve. I would be glad if you chose to use it. It is an early work in progress, so protocol coverage is incomplete and its APIs may change. The original [Cinegy/TsDecoder project](https://github.com/Cinegy/TsDecoder) remains an alternative.",
